203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e\u203e<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></h2>Fear of The Undead: Rise of the Evil offers 4 character choices, each with a different backstory, abilities, advantages and disadvantages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263220/extras/9c422ff2bc3b2a0cfdb98f916ba6b5a2.avif?t=1734125699\" /></span><br>Jack Miller is a German-Brazilian who found himself in the middle of the Palmares Outbreak, despite being just a regular citizen that is looking for his family, Jack's physical strength and skill with firearms made him able to fight against the waves of demons that appeared in his path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263220/extras/3bed3dd2c01a0d7450d329c817816c84.avif?t=1734125699\" /></span><br>The Vietnamese, Binh Phong, became a demon hunter after his village was destroyed by demons, in this unfortunate incident he met Virgolini and they've been working together ever since. Dispite what his age and appearance leads one to believe, Pong is a fast and flexible man, managing to escape death even on the hardest of situations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263220/extras/2a0cb4c41e40aafd9dbada0a3e632274.avif?t=1734125699\" /></span><br>The Italian, Giuseppe Virgolini, is a master of handling the mechanisms of a weapon, quickly learning its operation and making the best use of its internal capabilities. As he's a profissional church demon hunter, he has access to special artifacts and items that protect him against demonic forces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263220/extras/bc29cc56c238f3ad66ea4e9a50b1c7a6.avif?t=1734125699\" /></span><br>Philip Thompson is a veteran of the Scottish Army, with above-average accuracy, always knowing his opponents' weaknesses. In addition, Thompson is an experienced and charismatic leader, keeping the group togethe,  always trying to protect his men in battle. He occasionally works for the catholic church in some outbreak incidents.",
